Z||000012||b lo 0||02-06-2001||04:33 PM||||We don't get much snow here, and the little storm we had in Jan (the one that took my water pump and 2 hoses) I drove my Fiero-but when she isn't working right, I drive a 1990 Jeep Wrangler.  Chrome AR steelies, BFG A/T tires, roof lights, in the summer with the top down it really gets the girls!<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">     <BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.i-p.com" TARGET=_blank>www.audioimagery.i-p.com</A>  !!!<P><A HREF="http://clubs.excite.com/welcome/main?cid=.zXb1DJ1lsCL&aid=22&auth=" TARGET=_blank>Pontiac Fiero Owner's Club</A>-Pics, Videos and More-Or Post your Own||||reg||1
